i6"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257hg-i6"],"id":"long.record-257hg-i6","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.115 (Nonnegative centred carries below the half-value)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.115, p. 76, label record:257hg-i6","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*If $1\\notin A$ and $X_A(2)<1/2$, then\n$$\nC_A(N)=\\operatorname{ihc}(A,N)-1\\ge0\\qquad(N\\ge0).\n$$\nIndeed, Lemma 2.4 gives\n$$\n\\operatorname{ihc}(A,N)\n =2^{N+1}\\bigl(1/2-X_A(2)\\bigr)\n     +\\sum_{r\\ge1}c_A(N+1+r)2^{-r}>0.\n$$\nThe first term is strictly positive and the tail is nonnegative. Since the half-carry is an integer, it is at least $1$; subtracting $1$ proves the centred bound. Nonnegativity alone, without this strictness and integrality step, would only give $C_A(N)\\ge-1$. The argument supplies the lower bound used with the conditional upper bound in Theorem 6.84.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257hg-i6","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257hg-i6","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257hg-i6%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfCarryReachability.integerHalfCarry_eq_scaled_residual_add_tail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257hg-i6%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfCarryReachability.integerHalfCarry_eq_scaled_residual_add_tail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.HalfCarryReachability.integerHalfCarry_eq_scaled_residual_add_tail"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c